            <ArticleTitle>Digital radiography with dual-energy subtraction: improved evaluation of cardiac calcification.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1233-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">The objective of our study was to describe cardiac applications for digital radiography with dual-energy subtraction.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Dual-energy subtraction digital radiography offers potentially important new information in the assessment of coronary artery disease.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
